#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "POSIX threads library (I<libpthread>, I<-lpthread>)"
msgstr "Bibliothèque de threads POSIX (I<libpthread>, I<-lpthread>)"

